    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\">Diagnostic criteria for naevoid basal cell carcinoma syndrome (Gorlin syndrome)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Louis DN, Ohgaki H, Wiestler OD, et al., editors. WHO classification of tumours of the central nervous system. Lyon (France): International Agency for Research on Cancer; 2016. (WHO classification of tumours series, 4th rev. ed.; vol. 1). https://publications.iarc.who.int/543.",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 85.45pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 531.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 85.45pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"708\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Major criteria:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Lamellar (sheet-like) calcification of the falx</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Jaw keratocyst</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Palmar/plantar pits (&ge;&nbsp;2)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Multiple BCCs (&gt;&nbsp;5 in a lifetime) or a BCC before age 30&nbsp;years</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">First-degree relative with naevoid basal cell carcinoma syndrome</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 102.85pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 531.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 102.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"708\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Minor criteria:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Childhood <span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">medulloblastoma<sup>a</sup></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Lymphomesenteric or pleural cysts</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Macrocephaly (occipitofrontal circumference &gt;&nbsp;97th&nbsp;centile)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cleft lip/palate</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Vertebral/rib anomalies</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Preaxial or postaxial polydactyly</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Ovarian/cardiac fibromas</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Ocular anomalies</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 54.8pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 531.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 54.8pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"708\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Requirement for diagnosis:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Two major diagnostic criteria and one minor diagnostic criterion</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 16.05pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">OR</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">One major and three minor diagnostic criteria</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 16.05pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">OR</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Identification of a heterozygous constitutional <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">PTCH1</em> or <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">SUFU</em> pathogenic variant on molecular genetic testing</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">BCC, basal cell carcinoma.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">a</span></sup><span style=\"mso-no-proof: yes;\">Medulloblastoma</span> with sonic hedgehog activation, mostly desmoplastic/nodular or extensive nodular types.</p>",
